              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi naareeba enyamaishwa neetuuhuuka omu nyanja eine amahembe ikumi n'emitwe mushanju; aha mahembe gaayo hariho ebirunga ikumi, n'aha mitwe yaayo hariho eiziina ry'okurogota. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebyo nyamaishwa ei naareebire keaba neeshusha engwe, ebiganja byayo nibishusha eby'edubu, n'akanwa kaayo nikashusha ak'entare. Ekijoka kyagiha amaani gaakyo n'ekitebe ky'obukama bwakyo n'obushoboorozi bwingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 17:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ogumwe aha mitwe yaayo nooshusha oti gukaba gwine obuhuta obw'okugiita; kwonka obuhuta obwo bukakira; ab'ensi yoona baagikurata nibagitangaarira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi baaramya ekijoka ahabw'okuba kikaha egyo nyamaishwa obushoboorozi bwakyo; baaramya enyamaishwa egyo nibagira bati: N'oha orikushusha enyamaishwa egi? Kandi n'oha owaakubaasa kugirwanisa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
